# Impossible probe (log 2026-07-31): pressure inside the opening window.
# The AI groups carry a 1000-tick attack delay and its 3.7x advantage
# compounds with time, so its army is relatively weakest in the first
# ~700 samples -- the window the community sub-six-minute kill lives in,
# and the one no arm has concentrated on: every wave marches at the enemy
# start from the first rung instead of massing behind the lines.

